{"unit_id":"addxing__conservative-code-edits#feature-1","repo":"addxing/conservative-code-edits","commit":"ab3bd498867ceedf1fa2ee093ebb3f2c2df5dc9c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Conservative Code Edits 的功能「最小范围修改」：指导代理只改与任务直接相关的内容，并保持既有架构、交互、命名和实现模式。代理执行代码修改任务时应用这套技能规则。","source":"generated","evidence":["SKILL.md:7-9"]}
{"unit_id":"addxing__conservative-code-edits#feature-2","repo":"addxing/conservative-code-edits","commit":"ab3bd498867ceedf1fa2ee093ebb3f2c2df5dc9c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Conservative Code Edits 的功能「修改前确认影响」：当任务涉及架构、交互、模块职责或核心风格变化，或需要改动公共基础代码时，要求代理先说明原因和影响范围，再等待确认。","source":"generated","evidence":["SKILL.md:18-19"]}
{"unit_id":"addxing__conservative-code-edits#feature-3","repo":"addxing/conservative-code-edits","commit":"ab3bd498867ceedf1fa2ee093ebb3f2c2df5dc9c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Conservative Code Edits 的功能「遵循深色模式颜色规则」：当项目支持深色模式时，指导代理避免新增硬编码固定颜色，优先采用现有动态颜色资源或主题属性。规则随技能正文提供给运行时技能系统。","source":"generated","evidence":["SKILL.md:20","index.mjs:21-28"]}
